<title>UK: Allied London sells Elstree for 23.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Allied London sells Elstree for 23.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied London Properties Plc said on Tuesday it is selling Elstree Tower in Borehamwood, near London, to an overseas investor for 23.1 million stg.  </p>
<p>It said Elstree Tower was sold at its current book value.</p>
<p>The company also announced the purchase of the Yewtree Trading Estate in Haydock, Merseyside, for 9.75 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
